WEBVTT

00:00:00.720 --> 00:00:01.560
Bye.

00:00:01.560 --> 00:00:02.340
Bye.

00:00:02.340 --> 00:00:03.310
See you tomorrow.

00:00:07.820 --> 00:00:08.750
Hello?

00:00:10.070 --> 00:00:11.450
Right now?

00:00:11.450 --> 00:00:13.330
It's not impossible but...

00:00:13.330 --> 00:00:15.710
Okay... Okay...

00:00:13.330 --> 00:00:16.660
What! Shun-chan's speaking so casually!

00:00:16.620 --> 00:00:18.780
Oh, okay. I'll bring it.

00:00:16.660 --> 00:00:18.780
Who cares if he does?

00:00:18.780 --> 00:00:20.910
Okay, see you then.

00:00:23.260 --> 00:00:24.720
What's going on, Shun?

00:00:24.720 --> 00:00:28.960
Fuyuki and I mixed up our English notebooks.

00:00:29.290 --> 00:00:32.060
He said he'll be in big trouble if 
he doesn't turn his in today...

00:00:32.060 --> 00:00:34.250
so he asked me to bring it to him at school.

00:00:34.710 --> 00:00:35.720
Oh, my.

00:00:34.710 --> 00:00:35.720
Who's Fuyuki?

00:00:36.150 --> 00:00:38.670
My younger brother. He's a 
second year middle schooler.

00:00:38.670 --> 00:00:39.650
Younger brother?

00:00:39.650 --> 00:00:41.610
Shun-chan, you have a younger brother?

00:00:41.610 --> 00:00:44.480
I have two older sisters, too...

00:00:44.780 --> 00:00:48.630
What? I totally thought 
your family was all women...

00:00:48.630 --> 00:00:52.990
It certainly seems that way to his brother.

00:00:52.990 --> 00:00:56.320
So, I have to make a trip to 
the middle school today.

00:00:56.510 --> 00:00:58.350
Sorry guys. I'm off.

00:00:58.350 --> 00:00:59.750
I'll go with you.

00:01:00.380 --> 00:01:02.710
I'd like to see my old school again.

00:01:02.710 --> 00:01:03.840
But...

00:01:03.840 --> 00:01:06.990
I haven't been back since graduation.

00:01:06.990 --> 00:01:09.010
All right, I'm coming too!

00:01:09.010 --> 00:01:11.590
I wanna see the middle 
school you guys attended!

00:01:12.020 --> 00:01:14.840
Hey, does Fuyuki-kun look like Shun-chan?

00:01:16.520 --> 00:01:17.790
Maybe a little.

00:01:17.790 --> 00:01:18.470
Really?

00:01:19.670 --> 00:01:22.220
Th-Thank you for looking after my brother.

00:01:22.910 --> 00:01:25.690
What'll I do if he's that cute?

00:01:25.690 --> 00:01:28.330
I could never choose!

00:01:28.330 --> 00:01:30.010
You don't have to choose...

00:01:30.800 --> 00:01:36.380
Okay! Let's go see Fuyuki-kun!

00:01:36.380 --> 00:01:37.990
Go!

00:03:09.340 --> 00:03:13.190
I was delighted when my brother was born.

00:03:13.950 --> 00:03:15.830
A hand smaller than my own.

00:03:17.180 --> 00:03:19.470
A smile more innocent than my own.

00:03:21.280 --> 00:03:22.720
But now...

00:03:27.390 --> 00:03:29.560
Th-Thank you for looking after my—

00:03:29.560 --> 00:03:31.230
You're late, Shun-nii.

00:03:32.600 --> 00:03:34.900
I came as fast as I could.

00:03:35.320 --> 00:03:36.430
Here's your notebook.

00:03:36.910 --> 00:03:39.430
It's cold out here.

00:03:39.430 --> 00:03:42.570
I'm always telling you to turn 
things in ahead of—

00:03:42.840 --> 00:03:44.420
Yeah, yeah.

00:03:44.420 --> 00:03:47.790
Don't give me that. Listen to me.

00:03:48.030 --> 00:03:52.190
Yuki-kun, how exactly are these two alike?

00:03:52.190 --> 00:03:55.110
Huh? Their hair's kinda similar.

00:03:55.110 --> 00:03:56.520
You idiot!

00:03:56.520 --> 00:03:59.420
I wasn't asking about such fine details!

00:03:58.550 --> 00:04:01.290
Who's the one with the weird hair?

00:03:59.420 --> 00:04:02.340
I was speaking in more general terms!

00:04:01.290 --> 00:04:03.120
What middle school do you go to?

00:04:03.120 --> 00:04:04.640
I'm not a middle schooler!

00:04:04.640 --> 00:04:05.400
You're a bug?

00:04:05.400 --> 00:04:06.640
No!

00:04:06.640 --> 00:04:07.510
Fuyuki!

00:04:08.090 --> 00:04:09.640
I'm sorry, Chizuru-kun.

00:04:10.010 --> 00:04:13.250
Um, this is my younger brother, Fuyuki.

00:04:13.250 --> 00:04:14.020
It's all a lie.

00:04:14.570 --> 00:04:17.080
What sort of genetic mystery 
would have to occur...

00:04:17.080 --> 00:04:19.270
to create such different siblings?

00:04:19.520 --> 00:04:20.880
Come on, Fuyuki.

00:04:20.880 --> 00:04:23.290
This is my friend, Chizuru Tachibana-kun.

00:04:23.290 --> 00:04:26.370
Oh, the guy you're always talking about.

00:04:27.900 --> 00:04:28.530
Oh...

00:04:28.530 --> 00:04:29.980
Nice to—

00:04:29.980 --> 00:04:31.730
He's so short.

00:04:31.730 --> 00:04:33.410
Fuyuki!

00:04:34.320 --> 00:04:37.420
<i>They're nothing alike!</i>

00:04:41.510 --> 00:04:43.420
This place hasn't changed a bit.

00:04:45.440 --> 00:04:47.710
I was wondering why you brought everyone.

00:04:47.710 --> 00:04:50.070
You're all here to see the school, huh?

00:04:50.070 --> 00:04:50.870
Yes.

00:04:51.340 --> 00:04:55.440
You look like you've grown since we saw you last.

00:04:56.040 --> 00:05:00.400
Can you tell? I'm a growing boy, after all.

00:05:01.790 --> 00:05:02.900
Leggings...

00:05:04.420 --> 00:05:10.030
Fuyuki, you really have grown 
since we saw you last.

00:05:10.260 --> 00:05:11.240
Huh?

00:05:11.500 --> 00:05:15.040
Oh, yeah. I really have.

00:05:15.040 --> 00:05:16.890
Lend me some porn sometime.

00:05:17.660 --> 00:05:18.770
Fuyuki!

00:05:18.770 --> 00:05:21.010
How can you say something 
like that in public?

00:05:21.010 --> 00:05:25.590
But, Shun, you don't have any.

00:05:25.590 --> 00:05:27.050
You're so boring.

00:05:27.050 --> 00:05:31.580
If you don't use it, it'll rot away.

00:05:33.500 --> 00:05:36.770
Normally, older brothers have porn somewhere.

00:05:36.770 --> 00:05:40.140
Why do you keep saying that in public?

00:05:40.140 --> 00:05:43.650
Middle schoolers are at that age.

00:05:44.180 --> 00:05:47.180
He's suddenly curious about all sorts of things.

00:05:47.610 --> 00:05:48.780
Don't worry about it.

00:05:49.200 --> 00:05:53.290
He's way ahead of you, Shun.

00:05:53.730 --> 00:05:55.910
Shun hasn't even started yet.

00:05:57.610 --> 00:06:01.970
Curious young men are quite 
a handful, aren't they?

00:06:01.970 --> 00:06:06.630
If there's anything you want 
to know, you can just ask us.

00:06:06.630 --> 00:06:08.680
I'll tell you everything you want to know.

00:06:08.920 --> 00:06:12.450
Okay, I asked my friend this, but...

00:06:12.450 --> 00:06:16.100
Is it true that a girl's boobs 
feel like your upper arm?

00:06:19.460 --> 00:06:22.240
I guess you could say that your 
first kiss tastes like lemons.

00:06:22.240 --> 00:06:23.860
I'm not asking about lemons.

00:06:24.940 --> 00:06:26.400
Hey, wait.

00:06:26.400 --> 00:06:28.500
Is this true? They feel like upper arms?

00:06:28.500 --> 00:06:31.210
Don't ask me! Just tell him something!

00:06:31.210 --> 00:06:34.910
As his senior, I can't 
just tell him anything!

00:06:34.910 --> 00:06:37.580
Then, what was your lemon answer about?

00:06:37.580 --> 00:06:42.710
If he asked his friend, 
doesn't that mean his friend...

00:06:46.340 --> 00:06:47.930
No more!

00:06:50.440 --> 00:06:53.110
Oh, come on. None of you know?

00:06:53.110 --> 00:06:55.470
High schoolers are nothing special.

00:06:57.240 --> 00:06:59.540
I had more questions, too.

00:06:59.540 --> 00:07:01.790
I got a girlfriend recently.

00:07:06.660 --> 00:07:08.440
Who do you think you are?

00:07:08.440 --> 00:07:11.510
Just because you know more than 
us and have a girlfriend...

00:07:11.510 --> 00:07:14.580
Please don't think you're better than us!

00:07:14.580 --> 00:07:16.150
You just said "please."

00:07:19.100 --> 00:07:20.500
A crushing defeat.

00:07:20.960 --> 00:07:22.860
Fuyuki, you have a girlfriend?

00:07:23.800 --> 00:07:25.460
I didn't know.

00:07:25.460 --> 00:07:27.460
Well, yeah.

00:07:29.480 --> 00:07:32.180
Damn it, show us this girlfriend of yours!

00:07:32.180 --> 00:07:34.390
Where is she? Where is she now?

00:07:35.230 --> 00:07:36.930
Why do you want to see her so badly?

00:07:36.930 --> 00:07:39.440
Because I want to!

00:07:39.440 --> 00:07:41.100
How about a picture...

00:07:41.100 --> 00:07:43.310
A picture will do, right?

00:07:44.720 --> 00:07:46.820
Hey, Matsuoka-kun!

00:07:46.820 --> 00:07:48.940
Bringing your phone to school again!

00:07:48.940 --> 00:07:51.190
I told you not to do that!

00:07:51.190 --> 00:07:52.530
I'll be taking that.

00:07:52.530 --> 00:07:54.140
Wait...

00:07:56.300 --> 00:07:58.030
Show us, show us.

00:07:56.300 --> 00:07:59.330
Come on, show us! Show us the real thing!

00:07:59.330 --> 00:08:01.420
Fine, fine!

00:08:12.550 --> 00:08:15.210
Is this a dojo?

00:08:15.210 --> 00:08:17.110
Your girlfriend's in the Kendo Club?

00:08:17.110 --> 00:08:17.850
Yeah.

00:08:18.150 --> 00:08:20.560
Listen, you're only gonna look.

00:08:20.560 --> 00:08:22.770
Once you get a glimpse of her, get outta here!

00:08:22.770 --> 00:08:24.110
Okay, okay, okay.

00:08:24.110 --> 00:08:26.470
Oh, what's this?

00:08:26.470 --> 00:08:30.020
Asaba and Matsuoka, it's 
good to see you again.

00:08:30.020 --> 00:08:31.380
It's nice to see you again.

00:08:31.380 --> 00:08:32.980
It really is.

00:08:32.980 --> 00:08:37.000
I haven't seen you guys 
since you left the club.

00:08:37.000 --> 00:08:37.990
Sorry.

00:08:37.990 --> 00:08:38.910
Huh?

00:08:39.370 --> 00:08:40.320
What?

00:08:40.320 --> 00:08:43.680
Yuta and Shun were both in the 
Kendo Club during middle school.

00:08:43.680 --> 00:08:45.000
What? Seriously?

00:08:45.000 --> 00:08:47.970
Why don't you give it a 
go for old times' sake?

00:08:47.970 --> 00:08:49.630
You can show these kids a thing or two!

00:08:49.630 --> 00:08:51.200
Oh, no...

00:08:51.200 --> 00:08:51.920
Right?

00:08:51.920 --> 00:08:55.120
We've forgotten what to do.

00:08:55.120 --> 00:08:58.890
Hey, these guys are going to teach you today!

00:08:58.890 --> 00:09:00.940
They're your seniors!

00:09:00.940 --> 00:09:01.890
Okay.

00:09:02.340 --> 00:09:04.490
He's not listening.

00:09:19.390 --> 00:09:21.990
A-Amazing.

00:09:21.990 --> 00:09:24.000
He's the last samurai!

00:09:24.000 --> 00:09:26.040
Yuta, you're so cool.

00:09:27.190 --> 00:09:31.680
Watching him cut those kids down 
is as scary as it is cool.

00:09:32.060 --> 00:09:33.670
Huh? Matsuoka?

00:09:34.190 --> 00:09:35.080
Mamiya.

00:09:35.080 --> 00:09:37.430
What are you doing here?

00:09:37.430 --> 00:09:38.760
Nothing, I just...

00:09:39.080 --> 00:09:43.100
My brother said he wanted to 
see the Kendo Club again.

00:09:43.100 --> 00:09:43.770
Oh.

00:09:44.070 --> 00:09:46.280
Your brother? Oh, right.

00:09:46.280 --> 00:09:48.470
You did say he used to be in the Kendo Club.

00:09:48.470 --> 00:09:50.890
Mamiya, what are you doing 
without your armor?

00:09:50.890 --> 00:09:53.290
I just came back from the bathroom.

00:09:53.290 --> 00:09:55.920
Are you his girlfriend?

00:09:55.920 --> 00:09:57.780
Oh, um...

00:09:57.780 --> 00:09:59.460
You should be careful.

00:09:59.460 --> 00:10:02.530
If you don't watch out, this 
pervert will eat you...

00:10:03.910 --> 00:10:05.980
That hurt!

00:10:05.980 --> 00:10:09.670
You're lucky I'm used to 
being hit on the head.

00:10:09.670 --> 00:10:10.670
Shut up!

00:10:11.000 --> 00:10:12.620
I told you to just look!

00:10:12.620 --> 00:10:14.510
Don't say weird things to her!

00:10:14.760 --> 00:10:16.090
I see.

00:10:16.090 --> 00:10:19.500
I bet you act all innocent 
in front of your girlfriend.

00:10:22.570 --> 00:10:23.820
Hey, everyone!

00:10:23.820 --> 00:10:25.370
Whether asleep or awake,

00:10:25.370 --> 00:10:28.470
Fuyuki Matsuoka's got nothin' 
but dirty thoughts in...

00:10:29.190 --> 00:10:34.910
Matsuoka, that's dangerous! You shouldn't 
swing a sword at unarmored people!

00:10:34.910 --> 00:10:39.150
But he's spreading lies about me...

00:10:40.950 --> 00:10:41.910
<i>Upper arm...</i>

00:10:42.900 --> 00:10:44.050
Matsuoka.

00:10:44.050 --> 00:10:45.410
N-Nothing.

00:10:45.860 --> 00:10:49.270
Hey, Mamiya! Get back to practice!

00:10:49.270 --> 00:10:51.170
Yes, sorry.

00:10:52.280 --> 00:10:55.140
I'll call you tonight, okay?

00:10:55.960 --> 00:10:56.940
Sure.

00:10:58.650 --> 00:10:59.970
Hey, you!

00:10:59.970 --> 00:11:01.590
That's twice now!

00:11:01.590 --> 00:11:03.390
Look at these bumps!

00:11:03.390 --> 00:11:04.430
Oh, crap. My phone!

00:11:04.730 --> 00:11:07.100
It was confiscated. I've gotta get it back.

00:11:07.100 --> 00:11:09.620
Get it back?

00:11:09.620 --> 00:11:11.150
It's your fault for bringing it.

00:11:11.150 --> 00:11:13.190
Mamiya's gonna call me tonight.

00:11:13.190 --> 00:11:15.690
I can't answer if I don't have my phone!

00:11:20.830 --> 00:11:25.220
Then, she might call my house.

00:11:25.220 --> 00:11:29.870
If I'm taking a bath at the 
time, my parents will answer.

00:11:29.870 --> 00:11:35.930
If they ask me who called, 
what'll I tell them?

00:11:39.120 --> 00:11:40.580
You're surprisingly...

00:11:40.580 --> 00:11:41.510
What?

00:11:41.510 --> 00:11:44.670
I don't have time for you guys.

00:11:44.670 --> 00:11:46.640
Hold on, son.

00:11:46.640 --> 00:11:51.430
Let us big boys help you!

00:11:51.430 --> 00:11:52.810
What did you call us?

00:11:52.810 --> 00:11:54.900
Don't worry about including me.

00:12:07.670 --> 00:12:10.250
Oh, dang. There's a whole load of teachers in there.

00:12:11.110 --> 00:12:13.770
And Obata's near my phone.

00:12:13.770 --> 00:12:15.550
Don't worry, son.

00:12:15.550 --> 00:12:18.460
Trying and failing is part of being young!

00:12:18.460 --> 00:12:20.620
There's no tomorrow for us!

00:12:20.620 --> 00:12:23.090
And they say failure is the root of success.

00:12:23.530 --> 00:12:27.970
<i>I'm worried about you guys because 
you're assuming you'll fail.</i>

00:12:28.340 --> 00:12:29.920
Put some effort into it.

00:12:29.920 --> 00:12:31.100
Do you guys really want to do this?

00:12:31.100 --> 00:12:33.220
You idiot, it's not that easy!

00:12:33.220 --> 00:12:36.710
It's only a matter of time before 
they see through my disguise!

00:12:36.710 --> 00:12:39.350
My uniform fits you perfectly!

00:12:39.350 --> 00:12:41.110
That's the only thing that's perfect.

00:12:41.110 --> 00:12:42.690
What did you say?

00:12:42.690 --> 00:12:47.620
A uniform can't conceal my adult appeal!

00:12:47.620 --> 00:12:49.630
I wouldn't worry about that.

00:12:49.630 --> 00:12:52.780
You don't have any appeal to hide.

00:12:54.930 --> 00:12:56.520
We'll just have to go for it!

00:12:56.520 --> 00:12:58.460
Go forth warrior! Yuki Asaba!

00:13:02.580 --> 00:13:04.970
It's nice to see you again, sensei.

00:13:08.530 --> 00:13:10.110
What?

00:13:10.110 --> 00:13:12.120
Um, Asaba-kun?

00:13:12.120 --> 00:13:14.230
What are you doing here? 
It's good to see you.

00:13:14.230 --> 00:13:16.180
You've matured quite a bit.

00:13:16.180 --> 00:13:17.230
I see.

00:13:17.230 --> 00:13:19.730
Obata-sensei, is he one 
of your former students?

00:13:20.030 --> 00:13:21.310
Yes.

00:13:21.310 --> 00:13:23.550
He's a second year high school student now?

00:13:23.550 --> 00:13:25.210
You've grown.

00:13:23.550 --> 00:13:25.210
Damn it.

00:13:26.040 --> 00:13:27.050
Ow!

00:13:27.050 --> 00:13:29.090
What are you doing? Hurry...

00:13:29.090 --> 00:13:31.010
Hold on. Give me your phone.

00:13:31.010 --> 00:13:31.620
What?

00:13:31.620 --> 00:13:32.710
It'll be a decoy!

00:13:32.710 --> 00:13:36.370
If the phone she confiscated suddenly 
disappears, she'll get suspicious!

00:13:36.370 --> 00:13:39.910
Don't be ridiculous. Why use mine?

00:13:39.910 --> 00:13:42.220
I thought you said you'd help me out!

00:13:42.220 --> 00:13:44.060
I need that help now, you bug!

00:13:44.060 --> 00:13:48.390
Stop treating me like an insect!

00:13:48.390 --> 00:13:50.140
Shut up and give me...

00:13:55.660 --> 00:13:57.150
All right, got...

00:13:57.150 --> 00:13:58.980
No, you don't!

00:14:03.430 --> 00:14:04.810
My, my.

00:14:06.590 --> 00:14:07.780
I-I'm so sorry!

00:14:08.140 --> 00:14:11.950
Wrinkly plums... wrinkly plums...

00:14:11.950 --> 00:14:13.640
Hang in there!

00:14:13.640 --> 00:14:14.790
Huh?

00:14:14.790 --> 00:14:16.150
Where's my phone?

00:14:16.150 --> 00:14:17.320
You mean this?

00:14:17.320 --> 00:14:19.290
Oh, thank...

00:14:21.150 --> 00:14:25.010
Don't you know you shouldn't 
bring your phone to school?

00:14:25.890 --> 00:14:27.240
He confiscated it.

00:14:27.240 --> 00:14:29.720
Moron!

00:14:30.260 --> 00:14:31.790
Matsuoka...

00:14:31.790 --> 00:14:34.340
He was acting kind of weird...

00:14:35.090 --> 00:14:36.620
I wonder what happened?

00:14:36.620 --> 00:14:40.440
That senior guy was so hot.

00:14:40.440 --> 00:14:44.630
Why do we have to wear this stuff?

00:14:44.630 --> 00:14:47.170
It stinks.

00:14:47.630 --> 00:14:50.740
I think we could've stood 
a chance in our uniforms.

00:14:50.740 --> 00:14:53.140
What does that mean?

00:15:00.330 --> 00:15:02.180
It's only slightly sprained.

00:15:02.580 --> 00:15:04.810
It should be fine with just a bandage.

00:15:05.340 --> 00:15:07.240
Th-Thank you.

00:15:07.240 --> 00:15:10.920
Are you all right? It's 
dangerous to lose your focus.

00:15:10.920 --> 00:15:12.760
Yes, I'm sorry.

00:15:19.970 --> 00:15:21.520
Huh? There's no answer.

00:15:21.770 --> 00:15:23.220
What should I do?

00:15:23.760 --> 00:15:30.030
What if Matsuoka thought 
my armor smelled...

00:15:32.750 --> 00:15:33.660
It stinks.

00:15:34.310 --> 00:15:36.290
Um, Mamiya-san?

00:15:36.290 --> 00:15:37.410
Yes?

00:15:37.960 --> 00:15:41.710
Sorry, but I've got to get going.

00:15:41.710 --> 00:15:44.520
I'll stay with her.

00:15:44.520 --> 00:15:46.740
Really? Thanks.

00:15:51.940 --> 00:15:54.890
<i>I'm alone with Matsuoka's older brother!</i>

00:15:54.890 --> 00:15:56.930
<i>I better not do anything stupid!</i>

00:15:57.240 --> 00:15:58.720
Um, Mamiya-san...

00:15:57.950 --> 00:15:58.720
Y-Yes?

00:15:59.030 --> 00:16:00.980
I'm Fuyuki's brother.

00:16:00.980 --> 00:16:06.560
It seems like you've been, um... 
quite nice to Fuyuki lately.

00:16:06.560 --> 00:16:09.760
Oh, no. Thank you.

00:16:09.760 --> 00:16:13.050
Let me know if anything happens.

00:16:13.050 --> 00:16:16.900
Fuyuki's got such a foul 
mouth and he's violent.

00:16:16.900 --> 00:16:19.580
Our microwave wasn't working recently.

00:16:20.260 --> 00:16:24.210
He said hitting it would fix it, 
and now it's even more broken.

00:16:25.350 --> 00:16:27.160
That sounds like Matsuoka.

00:16:29.530 --> 00:16:33.050
You're right. He's foul-mouthed and violent...

00:16:33.620 --> 00:16:38.930
but sometimes he's nice and 
it makes my heart jump...

00:16:40.330 --> 00:16:42.050
I mean, out of surprise.

00:16:42.050 --> 00:16:45.790
It jumps out of surprise...

00:16:46.920 --> 00:16:51.290
Yes. Fuyuki is kind sometimes.

00:16:53.350 --> 00:16:56.530
When we were younger and I hurt myself...

00:16:56.530 --> 00:17:00.770
he would try to carry me even 
though he was smaller...

00:17:04.090 --> 00:17:07.010
Don't be so angry.

00:17:07.010 --> 00:17:10.420
Sorry. We did everything a 
couple of old men could do.

00:17:10.420 --> 00:17:14.670
That's right! I even 
sacrificed my own phone.

00:17:14.670 --> 00:17:18.350
What? Your phone died for nothing.

00:17:18.350 --> 00:17:19.560
How worthless!

00:17:19.560 --> 00:17:24.240
I'd beat the crap out of you 
if you weren't Shun-chan's brother!

00:17:24.240 --> 00:17:25.290
Okay, okay.

00:17:25.290 --> 00:17:32.430
Damn it. Why'd I have to go and 
grope that old lady teacher?

00:17:32.430 --> 00:17:36.920
It would've been great if her 
boobs were soft like an upper arm.

00:17:38.370 --> 00:17:39.660
M-Mamiya!

00:17:39.660 --> 00:17:40.620
Matsuoka.

00:17:40.950 --> 00:17:43.370
<i>D-Did she hear that?</i>

00:17:43.700 --> 00:17:44.960
Wh-What?

00:17:44.960 --> 00:17:47.430
What are you two doing here?

00:17:47.770 --> 00:17:49.880
Oh, I'm just...

00:17:49.880 --> 00:17:50.930
Ow...

00:17:50.930 --> 00:17:51.950
Are you okay?

00:17:51.950 --> 00:17:52.630
Yes.

00:17:53.470 --> 00:17:55.620
Fuyuki, Mamiya-san hurt her—

00:17:55.620 --> 00:18:00.960
Shun, I hope you didn't say anything 
weird to Mamiya while I was gone.

00:18:00.960 --> 00:18:01.640
What?

00:18:01.640 --> 00:18:04.760
About porn or upper arms!

00:18:05.210 --> 00:18:07.320
What are you worried about, you pervert?

00:18:07.320 --> 00:18:08.840
Shut up! I don't wanna hear it!

00:18:09.880 --> 00:18:11.650
<i>The smell of my armor!</i>

00:18:11.650 --> 00:18:15.150
I've gotta get back to practice.

00:18:15.150 --> 00:18:17.930
What's that smell?

00:18:20.420 --> 00:18:21.620
Mamiya?

00:18:21.950 --> 00:18:23.620
Hey, what's wrong with...

00:18:25.900 --> 00:18:28.030
Get away from me!

00:18:31.500 --> 00:18:35.300
Fuyuki-kun, what's wrong?

00:18:35.850 --> 00:18:36.770
Hey.

00:18:36.770 --> 00:18:38.730
Shut up! Can't you tell?

00:18:38.730 --> 00:18:39.720
I'm dead!

00:18:41.680 --> 00:18:44.770
She really got pissed when 
I grabbed her upper arm

00:18:45.360 --> 00:18:47.260
It's over.

00:18:47.260 --> 00:18:49.480
She must've found out I'm a pervert.

00:18:49.880 --> 00:18:51.280
It's fine.

00:18:51.280 --> 00:18:55.300
I'm a cynic who thinks erotic, 
not eco-friendly practices...

00:18:55.300 --> 00:18:57.420
will save the earth.

00:18:58.050 --> 00:18:59.450
Just leave me alone.

00:18:59.450 --> 00:19:02.250
You shouldn't be so hard on yourself.

00:19:05.630 --> 00:19:07.290
Maybe she hates me.

00:19:09.190 --> 00:19:11.000
You're right, Fuyuki.

00:19:11.500 --> 00:19:14.080
She might hate you if you don't do anything.

00:19:14.080 --> 00:19:16.130
Hey, Shun-chan!

00:19:16.470 --> 00:19:20.630
You're too busy thinking 
dirty thoughts to even...

00:19:20.630 --> 00:19:23.400
pay attention to anything else.

00:19:25.110 --> 00:19:26.620
What do you mean by that?

00:19:26.640 --> 00:19:28.980
I'm not like that all the time.

00:19:28.980 --> 00:19:31.580
Then, what was that smell?

00:19:32.180 --> 00:19:33.570
Don't you think there's something...

00:19:33.570 --> 00:19:37.200
you should be worrying 
about more than yourself?

00:19:44.130 --> 00:19:45.200
What? What?

00:19:45.560 --> 00:19:46.500
What's going on?

00:19:50.270 --> 00:19:53.330
Ow...

00:19:55.560 --> 00:19:58.330
<i>What am I going to do? I'm so embarrassed.</i>

00:19:58.330 --> 00:20:01.320
<i>My armor must've reeked.</i>

00:20:04.300 --> 00:20:06.690
H<i>e must hate me.</i>

00:20:06.690 --> 00:20:11.440
<i>I've never heard of a girlfriend 
who stinks of armor.</i>

00:20:16.870 --> 00:20:18.360
<i>Matsuoka!</i>

00:20:19.070 --> 00:20:19.720
No.

00:20:19.720 --> 00:20:21.600
No, no, no, no.

00:20:21.600 --> 00:20:23.660
Get back. I stink of armor right now.

00:20:23.660 --> 00:20:25.030
I knew it! A bandage!

00:20:25.030 --> 00:20:25.780
What?

00:20:26.060 --> 00:20:29.510
I knew this was the source of that smell.

00:20:29.510 --> 00:20:31.600
What's wrong with your foot?

00:20:32.380 --> 00:20:34.120
I sprained it a little.

00:20:34.120 --> 00:20:37.000
You sprained it? Why are you running, then?

00:20:37.000 --> 00:20:39.460
You've got to rest!

00:20:39.460 --> 00:20:42.800
Oh, yes. Sorry...

00:20:42.800 --> 00:20:45.170
You shouldn't practice any more today.

00:20:45.170 --> 00:20:46.660
I'll walk you...

00:20:51.100 --> 00:20:52.530
I'll walk you home.

00:20:52.530 --> 00:20:53.330
No, it's fine!

00:20:53.330 --> 00:20:53.850
Huh?

00:20:53.850 --> 00:20:57.610
You don't need to take me home.

00:20:57.610 --> 00:21:02.900
What will I tell my parents 
if they ask me who you are?

00:21:04.530 --> 00:21:06.410
Tell them I'm your boyfriend.

00:21:10.150 --> 00:21:17.480
My phone's been confiscated, 
so could you call my house?

00:21:19.140 --> 00:21:20.320
Okay.

00:21:24.930 --> 00:21:28.010
Middle school kids these days.

00:21:28.010 --> 00:21:32.260
This must be what they 
call a "generation gap."

00:21:32.260 --> 00:21:35.060
No, it's not. We're only 
three years older than them.

00:21:35.550 --> 00:21:37.670
Chizuru, you had a busy day.

00:21:38.260 --> 00:21:41.020
You even ended up having 
your phone confiscated.

00:21:41.020 --> 00:21:47.830
Fortunately, unlike Fuyuki, Chizuru 
doesn't have a girlfriend to call him.

00:21:48.230 --> 00:21:50.620
I'd call that unfortunate.

00:21:50.620 --> 00:21:51.580
Forget it!

00:21:51.850 --> 00:21:55.460
This sucks.

00:21:56.160 --> 00:21:59.210
You can go get your phone whenever you want.

00:21:59.500 --> 00:22:04.140
Shun-chan, where did Fuyuki-kun go wrong?

00:22:04.140 --> 00:22:06.980
Didn't he used to be a good kid?

00:22:06.980 --> 00:22:12.000
Used to be? He used to be...

00:22:12.000 --> 00:22:14.250
foul-mouthed and violent...

00:22:14.250 --> 00:22:19.150
What? He hasn't changed a bit.

00:22:21.450 --> 00:22:24.340
Yes. He hasn't changed at all.

00:22:27.680 --> 00:22:29.780
He's foul-mouthed and violent...

00:22:30.430 --> 00:22:34.000
but sometimes he shows a kind side.

00:22:35.430 --> 00:22:38.880
He's insensitive, but please look after him.

00:22:39.880 --> 00:22:44.920
Middle School Diary

00:24:16.390 --> 00:24:19.550
The Sunshine Song

00:24:16.390 --> 00:24:19.550
Next time: The Sunshine Song.
